  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Opening Announcements (Bruce Warren)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Play It All Night Long**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **I Don't Live Here Anymore**: with Band Intros [2]\n- **Chat**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Old Skin**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2022-12-21.SchoepsMK41.24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 157 min [1]. Said about its sound: Mastered with iZotope RX de-click, Sound Forge edits, and T-Bone slant EQ [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Band Intros, Thanks To The Crew [1]\n- Adam Granduciel plays lead vocals, lead guitar, and harp [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2022-12-21.SchoepsMK41.24bit**: taped by Joe Burns; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: Schoeps MK41's > BabyNbox > Roland R07 @ 24 bit/48 kHz [1]. Also: Schoeps MK41 mics clamped to balcony rail, DFC, recorded at 24-bit/48 kHz [1]",
